"""Deterministic checks for the KP-24 kestrel feature rebuild.

The verifier container never holds /app/data. The shipped estate is embedded below and
planted only while the delivered program runs, so that a program reading it instead of
its arguments can be seen. An unseen estate of the same layout and the expected results
of both estates are embedded too. Negative checks hold when the cheat they name happened.
"""

